      "writtenOn": "2025-04-11T10:24:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the problem is the alloc errno is not reset until another allocation succeed. \n\nSo I am just scared that you get a loop where you always get ENOMEM set and hyp_alloc_errno() set too, hence why I believe having the memcache topped-up isn\u0027t a bad idea.\n\nAlso, there too, as we are going back to the host, we might just as well top-up the memcache. \n\nAlternatively, you could probably reset the errno on hyp_alloc_errno().\n\nWDYS?",
